(VAR-44, VAR-45: what the check does not catch. A value arriving from a
 function call cannot be classified at compile time, so a text return
 assigned to a number name passes through unchecked and the number holds a
 raw address. A map read whose value types are uniform IS classified and
 rejected (that half of VAR-44 is on D1b.vox); a list read
 is not. The address is not stable across builds, so the probe asserts the
 shape; this build printed 4198488.
